From adf8cc43f48e3bd839c2fd36650637969523ce37 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: forge-shepherd <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 4 Jul 2026 17:40:24 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] feat: parameterize checks_green with ignore/only scoping
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

checks_green now accepts { ignore: [...] } (exempt named checks; every
other must be green) or { only: [...] } (require only the named checks,
present AND green). Both together, or a non-array ignore/only, is
malformed → fail-closed. Bare/ignore:[] keep the strict all-green
default. Exact name match. required_only stays a documented follow-up.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
